# convex
# `convex/_generated/` and `convex/betterAuth/_generated/` are deliberately NOT
# ignored (pattern from Bundestracker). They are derived, but they cannot be
# re-derived without deployment credentials (`bunx convex codegen` needs a
# CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT you can access), and without them a clean checkout cannot
# typecheck or run the Convex tests — so CI could not run the gates at all.
# Convex's own CLI says they "should be committed to the repo".
# `bun run check:codegen` catches the one way they go stale offline (a module
# added without regenerating). Regenerate with `bunx convex dev --once`.
.convex/

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
